  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Alumni export readiness</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of this project is to support growing young businesses &#x2013; on the coastal stretch between Abidjan, Accra and Lagos &#x2013; with innovative and tailored tools, that will help them to professionalise, expand and internationalise their business at a regional level. Furthermore, the project aims to support Entrepreneurship Support Organisations in strengthening their export and access to (international) markets knowhow, so that they can improve their export and internationalisation services.</narrative>
  </description>
